7-09T17:48:42Z"},"body":"See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113181#issuecomment-3582422666\r\n\r\nIf script editors should be used in vertical orientations, unnecessary width in the gutters hurts even normal sized lines of code from being edited. \r\n\r\nThis PR removes extra white-space in the script editors. It removes the left-margin on the panel, the arbitrary right-margin on the line numbers, and reduces the size of the main gutter if only the bookmarks are showing. Together these changes remove more than a third of the width of the shader editor gutter, which will help give more room to the user.\r\n\r\nIt might also be worth it to set `line_numbers_min_digits` to 2 for shaders as they are smaller files in general than `.gdscript` files\r\n\r\nIn the screenshots below I modified the code to display the positions of the gutters to better illustrate the changes\r\n| Before: | After: |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"687\" height=\"783\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57e710cd-f6fe-4a10-b03f-aa5429598721\" /> | <img width=\"688\" height=\"783\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa60282d-b818-4206-8e39-03bb2697d0db\" /> |","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}"